## Phase 5 - Verification

- [ ] `dkms status` - every module built `installed` for the new kernel
- [ ] GPU / display works (and SR-IOV / passthrough if used)
- [ ] Audio works (PipeWire restart crash during the swap is benign)
- [ ] `apt-get check` and `dpkg --audit` clean; no broken packages
- [ ] Snaps / Flatpaks refreshed if used
- [ ] `lsb_release -a` shows the new release

